cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark suite, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "disscube-benchmark: Quantitative Numerical and Spatial Parity Benchmark for DisSCube against Canonical TerraME Goldens"
abstract: "Automated benchmarking suite and continuous integration harness measuring cell-by-cell numerical parity, spatial metrics, and residual divergence between declarative data cube operators in DisSCube and canonical TerraME 2.0.1 goldens."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-02
license: MIT
